    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable pets will accompany you. As you tap on the keyboard, the adorable pets will also tap the corresponding keys. As your writing companion, the adorable pets will work hard together with you! O(\u2229_\u2229)O~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various typing adorable pets to choose from, making your typing experience more interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619310/extras/27c0f1496552d9b96e7d3b306efc5cf9.poster.avif?t=1745918968\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619310/extras/27c0f1496552d9b96e7d3b306efc5cf9.webm?t=1745918968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619310/extras/27c0f1496552d9b96e7d3b306efc5cf9.mp4?t=1745918968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item Drop Probability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Common - 90%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fine - 5%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Rare - 0.5%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Epic - 0.01%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Legendary - One in five hundred thousand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Mythic - One in ten million</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This may change in future versions.</p>",
